]]></description><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 15:01:50 +0000</pubDate><link>https://bouncemarket.minhanhday.com/</link><dc:creator>mday404</dc:creator><comments>https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50667726</comments><guid isPermaLink="false">https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50667726</guid></item><item><title><![CDATA[Show HN: I restored Palm's last device, and brought its OS to other platforms]]></title><description><![CDATA[
<p>webOS Community Edition 3.2.0 is the first OTA Update for Palm/HP's TouchPad, modernizing a 15-year old device. Lunacy is its sibling: the webOS experience, and apps, on Android. Luna DE is a developer tool that brings the webOS app contract to Mac, Windows and Linux as a SDK-compatible Electron app.</p>
